    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Magic action: throw the figurine to a point within 60 ft and it becomes the creature (it obeys you and takes its turn right after yours). Magic action while touching it, or 0 HP: it reverts (delete the token). Three figurines, each with its own activity. <strong>Goat of Terror</strong>: a Giant Goat for up to 3 hours (15 days). It can't attack. <strong>Remove a Horn</strong> (Magic action) gives you a +1 Lance or a +2 Longsword until it reverts. While you ride it (use <strong>Ride the Goat of Terror</strong>), each Hostile creature that starts its turn within 30 ft of the goat makes a DC 15 WIS save or is Frightened for 1 minute (repeat save at the end of each of its turns; immune for 24 hours after a success). <strong>Goat of Traveling</strong>: a Riding Horse; 24 charges, 1 per hour or part of an hour (spend extra hours on the sheet); it regains them 7 days after it runs out. <strong>Goat of Travail</strong>: a Giant Goat for up to 3 hours (30 days).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
